# BUGS

Only one function is found, 01:00.0: a multi-function device's other functions and a switch behind the root port are not.
The host is brought up once, when the driver starts: a device put in later, or a link that goes down, isn't seen.
No prefetchable window, no I/O window, and no INTx: a function interrupts by MSI or MSI-X.
The DMA a function does reaches the first 2 GiB of memory, the part of the K1's PCIe bus window below its memory hole.
